    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled breed styling and deshedding"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the quality of haircuts, thorough deshedding treatments, and pleasant-smelling coats for both dogs and cats. Owners of double-coated breeds like Huskies, Pomeranians, and Samoyeds note immaculate finishing. While most are thrilled, two reviewers experienced issues with uneven lengths or haircuts trimmed shorter than requested."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and compassionate grooming professionals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently describe Alessandro, Maglen, and their team as exceptionally caring, patient, and welcoming. Pet owners value the thoughtful consultations and the genuine affection shown toward every animal. Multiple clients note that the team takes pride in their craft and makes both pets and their owners feel completely comfortable."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A significant number of reviews highlight the spa's gentle approach with reactive, anxious, or medically vulnerable animals, including dogs with sensitive tracheas and shy rescue pups. Pet owners appreciate that groomers take time to read body language and offer breaks, though one client reported high stress when their cat had to wait before styling."
      }
    }
  ],
