        "en": "Can the salon accommodate dogs with behavioral sensitivities?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners report successful grooming visits for reactive, nervous, or kennel-sensitive pets, noting that groomers read body language and allow breaks."
      },
